# Currency formatting

User-visible money is always USD with thousands separators and two decimals (e.g. `$1,550.00`).

## Required helpers

- Site / Astro / browser: `formatMoney` from `src/lib/money.ts`
- API messages, emails, lease/legal docs: `formatMoney` from `api/src/lib/leaseTerms.js`

Do not invent a third formatter. Do not use `` `$${(cents / 100).toFixed(2)}` `` for display — it drops grouping.

## Allowed exceptions

- `<input type="number">` values may stay ungrouped (`1550.00`)
- Static marketing copy for small fixed fees (e.g. “$20 pet rent”) when not computed from cents

See `docs/architecture/ui-style-guide.md` → **Currency**.
